    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "destination_id": 1,
      "user_id": 5,
      "rating": 5,
      "comment": "One of the best mornings of my life. The lake is breathtaking, and the traditional breakfast at the end was delicious. Highly recommend!",
      "language": "en",
      "created_at": "2025-02-16T09:30:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "destination_id": 2,
      "user_id": 4,
      "rating": 5,
      "comment": "Tikal exceeded all my expectations. Standing on Temple IV above the jungle canopy at dawn was surreal. The guide's knowledge of Mayan history was exceptional.",
      "language": "en",
      "created_at": "2025-02-20T15:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "destination_id": 3,
      "user_id": 5,
      "rating": 4,
      "comment": "Pedro was very knowledgeable about Antigua's history. The chocolate tasting was a highlight! The tour could be a bit longer to cover more sites.",
      "language": "en",
      "created_at": "2025-02-22T14:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "destination_id": 5,
      "user_id": 4,
      "rating": 5,
      "comment": "Semuc Champey is one of the most beautiful places I have ever seen. The cave exploration was thrilling and the turquoise pools are unreal. Do not miss this!",
